Package: convertxlsform
Type: Package
Title: Convert an XLSForm to a Word or PDF Document
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Masud", "Rahman", email = "write2masud+convertxlsform@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts XLSForm questionnaires, as used by Open Data Kit (ODK) and
    KoboToolbox, into formatted paper versions for interviewing and review.
    Output is a Microsoft Word document (.docx) or, optionally, a PDF produced
    from that Word document with LibreOffice. Supports multilingual forms,
    nested question numbering, skip logic display, and question and choice
    media.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/masud90/convertxlsform
BugReports: https://github.com/masud90/convertxlsform/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
